# Story page: settings
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Behind the Curtain
---
{name} found a heavy velvet curtain and, being a snake of great curiosity and very little judgment, slithered behind it.

There it found dials, switches and a lever marked GOOGLY, which is to say the inner workings of the world, adjustable by anyone with the nerve.

'Please do not touch anything,' I whispered. {name} touched everything. I have since learned to whisper less and expect less, which is a fair summary of my career.
